after months of negotiation with the  chinese government  members of the world health organization  team have arrived in wuhan  on a mission to trace the origins of  kobe 19.  we'll be looking at the in more detail  at the initial  cases the human cases that were detected  in december 19  looking at the market the famous wuhan  market and see  what happened there the team will also  investigate the theory that the virus  first came from an animal  and hopes to gain access to wuhan's  institute of virology  the trump administration has claimed  without evidence that the pandemic was  caused by a leak from this laboratory  u.s secretary of state mike pompeo has  accused the chinese government of a  cover-up  and on tuesday tweeted that the who was  corrupted by beijing  the u.n agency has denied the claims and  says its focus  is not about assigning blame but  uncovering facts to fight the pandemic  beijing has so far tightly controlled  any investigation into the outbreak's  origin  the who's mission comes as china is  struggling to contain an outbreak in the  country's north  with more than 700 cases discovered in a  week and the first coronavirus death  recorded in eight months  discovering the origins of kova 19 has  become highly politicized  many governments around the world have  been calling for an independent inquiry  but many are skeptical the chinese  government will provide full  access meanwhile the communist party has  been circulating its own narrative  about the outbreak's origins chinese  state media have been pushing reports  that the coronavirus was first  discovered in europe  in late 2019. beijing has been stoking  the theory  by pointing to traces of the virus on  imported frozen food  the who says this is highly speculative  but many residents in wuhan are  convinced  i welcome the who team to ohan to look  for the origin  because i don't believe china is where  it started  we were set up it didn't originate in  wuhan  not even in china health experts say  it's unlikely the who team will discover  the source of covert 19  anytime soon and additional missions may  be needed  it took them some 10 years to find the  origin of stars  how long would it take for kobe maybe  less time  because we have more experience but kobe  spreads more easily  and is more complicated it will take  time to find  definitive answers the team of experts  from around the world will work with  chinese scientists in wuhan  but first they'll be 14 days of  quarantine  katrina u al jazeera beijing
 

